WEBVTT

00:22.840 --> 00:26.300
<b>Lightning, shoot through
my enemies before me!</b>

00:26.840 --> 00:29.130
<b>All Drifa Chain Lightning!</b>

00:33.850 --> 00:35.720
<b>We're done here.</b>

00:35.720 --> 00:36.430
<b>Yes!</b>

00:36.430 --> 00:39.820
<b>Already done? So boring.</b>

00:39.820 --> 00:42.940
<b>What do you do now, Naofumi?
Gonna back up Fohl?</b>

00:43.220 --> 00:45.940
<b>No, he'll be fine by now.</b>

00:50.110 --> 00:53.700
<b>My father fought bravely
and believed in his fellow soldiers!</b>

00:59.710 --> 01:03.590
<b>I can't forgive anyone who would do
such a contemptible thing to him!</b>

01:04.750 --> 01:06.330
<b>Shut up!</b>

01:06.330 --> 01:08.920
<b>I'll send you straight to
your parents right now!</b>

01:12.440 --> 01:15.010
<b>I still have things I must do!</b>

01:15.460 --> 01:18.710
<b>Like daring to kill a god!</b>

01:28.780 --> 01:30.110
<b>Master Naofumi.</b>

01:30.110 --> 01:30.920
<b>Oh, my...</b>

01:30.900 --> 01:32.570
<b>Blue Eggu Shield (Appraisal 1) activated</b>

01:30.920 --> 01:32.570
<b>They got back on their feet again?!</b>

01:32.570 --> 01:34.030
<b>They're...</b>

01:45.120 --> 01:49.080
<b>The Rising of the Shield Hero</b>

03:19.510 --> 03:24.050
<b>Episode 5: Hakuko</b>

03:22.220 --> 03:24.310
<b>What's going on here?</b>

03:30.030 --> 03:32.580
<b>There's no end to them!</b>

03:32.580 --> 03:34.850
<b>Yeah, they're just like zombies.</b>

03:34.850 --> 03:36.030
<b>Zombie?</b>

03:36.320 --> 03:41.490
<b>Did Jaralis perform the same kind of body
modification on them like Kyo used to do?!</b>

03:49.980 --> 03:51.500
<b>So fast...!</b>

03:59.930 --> 04:02.890
<b>My eyes!</b>

04:05.430 --> 04:07.940
<b>Keep it up, big brother!</b>

04:09.900 --> 04:11.150
<b>What?!</b>

04:12.600 --> 04:15.280
<b>Blood... I need more blood...</b>

04:15.280 --> 04:16.990
<b>No, power...</b>

04:16.990 --> 04:18.950
<b>I need more power!</b>

04:32.140 --> 04:33.420
<b>What is he doing...?</b>

04:33.420 --> 04:35.880
<b>Cannibalism...</b>

04:53.590 --> 04:56.210
<b>Fohl! This isn't even a duel anymore!</b>

04:57.390 --> 05:00.280
<b>We're joining the fight too
from here! Got it?!</b>

05:02.820 --> 05:03.690
<b>Let's go!</b>

05:03.690 --> 05:04.830
<b>Yes!</b>

05:13.000 --> 05:15.450
<b>High Quick!</b>

05:18.460 --> 05:21.630
<b>It's a big clump of gooey flesh-clay! Gross!</b>

05:22.840 --> 05:25.850
<b>Consuming their bodies
will give me more power!</b>

05:27.350 --> 05:31.690
<b>Hurry! Protect the Shield Hero
and take down that heinous criminal!</b>

05:32.940 --> 05:34.520
<b>That is...?!</b>

05:39.400 --> 05:42.530
<b>My words... Is that Jaralis?!</b>

05:42.880 --> 05:45.080
<b>Raphtalia, Fohl, Atla!</b>

05:45.080 --> 05:47.870
<b>You might get absorbed too! Stay back!</b>

05:48.430 --> 05:49.250
<b>Understood!</b>

05:49.560 --> 05:51.500
<b>As you command, Master Naofumi!</b>

05:51.500 --> 05:55.060
<b>You guys too!
Don't take a single step closer!</b>

05:59.190 --> 06:00.460
<b>Big brother!</b>

06:03.720 --> 06:07.560
<b>I am the supreme being!
I have obtained power beyond the god!</b>

06:07.560 --> 06:11.350
<b>With this power, the whole world will be mine!</b>

06:11.350 --> 06:14.860
<b>Jaralis! I'll end your life here!</b>

06:14.860 --> 06:16.310
<b>This is for my father's revenge!</b>

06:32.160 --> 06:33.330
<b>Fohl!</b>

06:41.130 --> 06:42.340
<b>He's...</b>

06:43.250 --> 06:44.550
<b>Would you like to empower the target and force a beast transformation?</b>

06:55.260 --> 06:56.850
<b>Would you like to empower the target and force a beast transformation?</b>

06:57.310 --> 06:58.280
<b>Fohl!</b>

06:58.810 --> 07:02.070
<b>Are you prepared to become even stronger?</b>

07:03.110 --> 07:06.030
<b>Yes. Obviously.</b>

07:06.390 --> 07:09.770
<b>For Atla, and more than anything,
for myself...</b>

07:09.770 --> 07:13.250
<b>I want to be stronger to defeat this guy!</b>

07:14.100 --> 07:15.320
<b>I see.</b>

07:17.710 --> 07:19.170
<b>Let's do this then!</b>

07:19.160 --> 07:20.620
<b>Would you like to empower the target and force a beast transformation?</b>

07:31.970 --> 07:33.430
<b>What?!</b>

07:33.430 --> 07:34.890
<b>Big brother...</b>

07:35.270 --> 07:37.100
<b>Master Naofumi! This is...</b>

07:37.360 --> 07:39.880
<b>This is truly a miracle of a god.</b>

07:39.880 --> 07:43.570
<b>It seems the legends are true after all.</b>

07:53.450 --> 07:56.440
<b>My body is overflowing with power!</b>

07:56.440 --> 07:58.910
<b>Is this really me?</b>

07:59.420 --> 08:01.880
<b>You... It can't be!</b>

08:02.580 --> 08:07.500
<b>It seems Naofumi's skill has
transformed Fohl into a beast too.</b>

08:07.500 --> 08:08.840
<b>That's right.</b>

08:08.840 --> 08:13.460
<b>All of his stats have increased rapidly.</b>

08:13.460 --> 08:16.600
<b>He's on a different level than Filo,
maybe even surpassing Raphtalia!</b>

08:20.770 --> 08:24.120
<b>But there's a time limit
to how long this will last...</b>

08:24.120 --> 08:26.510
<b>Fohl! Finish him quickly!</b>

08:30.260 --> 08:34.030
<b>No matter how much blessing you get
from the Shield Hero, it's useless!</b>

08:34.030 --> 08:37.040
<b>I will slay the old gods!</b>

08:37.040 --> 08:40.460
<b>This is the dawn of a new myth!</b>

08:43.170 --> 08:43.840
<b>What?!</b>

08:47.210 --> 08:50.220
<b>You're too slow.
Are you fooling around?</b>

08:50.220 --> 08:55.560
<b>Damn you! Getting carried away just because
you gained power through dirty tricks!</b>

08:55.560 --> 08:59.650
<b>You're one to talk, you monster!</b>

08:59.650 --> 09:03.140
<b>Monster? You dare call me a monster?!</b>

09:03.140 --> 09:08.000
<b>Don't be absurd! I am godlike!</b>

09:11.460 --> 09:15.410
<b>Impossible...  Am I a monster?</b>

09:15.410 --> 09:18.130
<b>No! It can't be!</b>

09:18.130 --> 09:23.350
<b>I can't believe it!
This isn't me!</b>

09:29.880 --> 09:31.010
<b>Atla?</b>

09:31.370 --> 09:35.510
<b>Big brother, concentrate all of your power
into a single point and run him through!</b>

09:35.880 --> 09:37.300
<b>Got it!</b>

09:42.770 --> 09:46.300
<b>You better not fall off, Atla!</b>

09:46.980 --> 09:51.880
<b>That's the legendary technique passed down
only among the ancient Hakuko...</b>

09:51.880 --> 09:54.200
<b>The Assault of the Ferocious Tiger Tyrant!</b>

09:54.200 --> 09:58.630
<b>Are you watching, Lord Tiran, Lady Lucia?</b>

10:18.930 --> 10:20.840
<b>I-Impossible!</b>

10:20.840 --> 10:27.360
<b>That potion was supposed to make me
the strongest therianthrope!</b>

10:27.880 --> 10:32.720
<b>That bastard...! I've been tricked!</b>

10:49.150 --> 10:51.960
<b>We did it! We exterminated the traitor!</b>

10:54.380 --> 10:57.220
<b>Huh? Fohl, your body...</b>

11:01.560 --> 11:03.930
<b>Lord Fohl, Lady Atla!</b>

11:04.200 --> 11:07.810
<b>You have truly fulfilled your mission!</b>

11:11.160 --> 11:12.310
<b>Father...</b>

11:13.410 --> 11:14.610
<b>I have avenged...</b>

11:15.560 --> 11:16.680
<b>...your death.</b>

11:17.690 --> 11:21.870
<b>Huh? Big brother?
Are you alright? Big brother!</b>

11:21.870 --> 11:24.990
<b>Atla, maybe you should get off him first.</b>

11:24.990 --> 11:26.040
<b>Why?</b>

11:26.470 --> 11:29.190
<b>Why? Because you're going to crush him.</b>

11:29.190 --> 11:31.960
<b>If he can't endure this much,
what's he going to do?</b>

11:31.960 --> 11:35.100
<b>Wow, Fohl is totally squished!</b>

11:35.100 --> 11:36.350
<b>Oh my...</b>

11:39.550 --> 11:41.740
<b>The morning after the riot...</b>

11:41.740 --> 11:46.580
<b>The search quickly began for those who were
said to have handed the potion to Jaralis</b>

11:46.580 --> 11:48.400
<b>and aided his rebellion.</b>

11:48.690 --> 11:52.600
<b>However, it seems they disappeared
the moment Jaralis was defeated.</b>

11:53.240 --> 11:55.320
<b>The medicine was to be analyzed,</b>

11:55.320 --> 11:58.570
<b>and I decided to call Rat to investigate.</b>

12:01.550 --> 12:04.290
<b>This looks like it'll be worth analyzing.</b>

12:05.330 --> 12:10.430
<b>Once again, we apologize for ever
calling you tainted-blooded Hakuko.</b>

12:11.540 --> 12:14.840
<b>You are truly the rightful people of Siltvelt.</b>

12:15.400 --> 12:17.260
<b>You have our deepest respect.</b>

12:23.110 --> 12:27.310
<b>So? Does this mean
we technically won the duel?</b>

12:27.310 --> 12:28.230
<b>Yes.</b>

12:28.640 --> 12:31.980
<b>But at this point, the outcome
of the duel no longer matters.</b>

12:33.280 --> 12:35.190
<b>There is an old legend.</b>

12:35.190 --> 12:40.070
<b>It says that the one who unlocks
the true form of Siltvelt's people...</b>

12:40.070 --> 12:42.700
<b>...is the 'Hero of the Time to Come.'</b>

12:43.160 --> 12:46.520
<b>Everything is as you command, Shield Hero.</b>

12:47.210 --> 12:49.450
<b>A ship to Q'ten Lo has already been arranged.</b>

12:49.870 --> 12:52.170
<b>Preparations should be complete in two days.</b>

12:54.660 --> 12:59.600
<b>Until then, please relax and enjoy
your stay here in Siltvelt.</b>

12:59.600 --> 13:04.100
<b>Why don't you take a look
around the castle?</b>

13:09.690 --> 13:11.750
<b>I'm glad for both of you.</b>

13:11.750 --> 13:16.980
<b>Yeah. But what makes me happiest is that
we were able to restore our father's honor.</b>

13:17.620 --> 13:21.150
<b>And I'm finally free from the castle,
so I can take this time to relax.</b>

13:21.150 --> 13:22.780
<b>Mr. Hero!</b>

13:24.610 --> 13:26.200
<b>Werner and the others were saying</b>

13:26.200 --> 13:28.660
<b>- Lord Fohl!
- that we'll have a triumphant parade...</b>

13:28.950 --> 13:33.570
<b>We can do that as much as we want after
the Q'ten Lo and the Phoenix issues are done.</b>

13:34.100 --> 13:35.800
<b>More importantly, Fohl.</b>

13:37.170 --> 13:39.170
<b>You said there was somewhere you wanted to go.</b>

13:39.650 --> 13:40.600
<b>Is it really okay?</b>

13:40.600 --> 13:42.280
<b>Somewhere you want to go?</b>

13:47.990 --> 13:49.180
<b>This is...</b>

13:49.180 --> 13:52.640
<b>...our father and mother's grave, isn't it?</b>

13:53.880 --> 13:59.120
<b>Fohl had refused to have their father's grave
and their mother's, who rests beside him,</b>

13:59.120 --> 14:03.040
<b>rebuilt even though their
honor had been restored.</b>

14:03.410 --> 14:09.870
<b>He said, "If it were them,
they'd want it to stay as it is."</b>

14:10.550 --> 14:14.880
<b>His rapid growth is probably due
to his demi-human nature.</b>

14:14.880 --> 14:17.640
<b>But his beast transformation,
his full beast form,</b>

14:17.990 --> 14:22.300
<b>and most of all, the experience of defeating
the powerful enemy who killed his parents...</b>

14:22.300 --> 14:23.970
<b>...are likely the biggest reasons.</b>

14:25.620 --> 14:28.440
<b>Atla seemed quite envious of it.</b>

14:31.360 --> 14:33.480
<b>Lord Fohl, Lady Atla...</b>

14:33.480 --> 14:36.190
<b>There's another place
I'd like to take you both.</b>

14:40.190 --> 14:43.110
<b>Fohl and Atla's childhood home, huh.</b>

14:43.430 --> 14:48.130
<b>After the death of their parents,
Lord Fohl sold it to cover</b>

14:48.130 --> 14:49.880
<b>Lady Atla's medical expenses.</b>

14:49.880 --> 14:51.880
<b>I'm sorry, Atla...</b>

14:51.880 --> 14:55.080
<b>Big brother, we agreed not to
talk about that, remember?</b>

14:55.470 --> 14:58.210
<b>Now that the current owner
has learned what happened,</b>

14:58.210 --> 15:00.390
<b>he's offered to return it to them.</b>

15:00.390 --> 15:03.510
<b>Oh? What a kind owner.</b>

15:03.970 --> 15:07.100
<b>He was a close friend of our father's.</b>

15:07.100 --> 15:08.960
<b>He even bought it at a high price.</b>

15:09.600 --> 15:11.220
<b>Ah, I see...</b>

15:15.580 --> 15:18.080
<b>This road is so bumpy...</b>

15:18.080 --> 15:19.900
<b>We're finally here.</b>

15:19.900 --> 15:23.110
<b>So, which one's your house?</b>

15:23.580 --> 15:27.810
<b>Don't tell me it's that huge one over there?</b>

15:27.810 --> 15:30.280
<b>Actually, it is...</b>

15:30.280 --> 15:31.730
<b>Seriously?</b>

15:33.520 --> 15:35.040
<b>This place is huge.</b>

15:35.480 --> 15:38.060
<b>And it's got all sorts of details.</b>

15:38.380 --> 15:41.200
<b>The windows look like shoji screens,
but something's different.</b>

15:41.200 --> 15:42.380
<b>Shoji?</b>

15:42.660 --> 15:45.810
<b>This house has Chinese style in it.</b>

15:45.810 --> 15:47.610
<b>Master!</b>

15:48.730 --> 15:50.930
<b>The tiger's eyes are gone.</b>

15:51.490 --> 15:54.800
<b>Yeah. I sold anything that was worth money.</b>

15:55.880 --> 15:58.670
<b>You've had it rough ever since
your spoiled rich kid days, huh.</b>

15:58.670 --> 16:00.020
<b>Leave me alone.</b>

16:00.520 --> 16:02.190
<b>This was Father's study.</b>

16:02.720 --> 16:05.290
<b>He even left it just the way it was.</b>

16:05.290 --> 16:06.900
<b>Man, this is nostalgic.</b>

16:09.950 --> 16:11.760
<b>This is the dressing room.</b>

16:11.760 --> 16:15.560
<b>We used to have traditional
Hakuko clothing here.</b>

16:16.640 --> 16:18.040
<b>Wait, this is...</b>

16:18.320 --> 16:21.460
<b>Weren't you supposed to
have sold this, big brother?</b>

16:21.460 --> 16:23.250
<b>Yeah. But why?</b>

16:23.650 --> 16:25.470
<b>Maybe he gave it back?</b>

16:25.890 --> 16:28.050
<b>To me, it's more like I just borrowed it.</b>

16:28.050 --> 16:30.010
<b>I'll earn the money</b>

16:30.760 --> 16:34.680
<b>and buy back both the house
and these clothes, no matter what.</b>

16:34.940 --> 16:36.350
<b>You're so serious.</b>

16:36.350 --> 16:39.390
<b>By the way, you still owe me
money too, you know?</b>

16:40.120 --> 16:41.810
<b>Cut it out now, Master Naofumi.</b>

16:42.320 --> 16:43.820
<b>Atla, why don't you try it on?</b>

16:44.170 --> 16:50.450
<b>Eh? If I wear it, will I be as charming
as Raphtalia in her miko outfit?!</b>

16:51.790 --> 16:54.600
<b>Does that mean I'm only charming
if I'm in a miko outfit?</b>

16:54.600 --> 16:57.850
<b>Who knows?
I'm gonna check out the kitchen.</b>

16:57.850 --> 17:00.960
<b>If we're staying the night,
I should start preparing dinner.</b>

17:00.960 --> 17:04.940
<b>I'm getting changed now,
so you need to leave, big brother!</b>

17:04.940 --> 17:05.960
<b>Atla?</b>

17:06.710 --> 17:09.850
<b>Raphtalia, help Atla get dressed, okay?</b>

17:09.850 --> 17:10.930
<b>Understood.</b>

17:10.930 --> 17:13.800
<b>I'll show off my beautiful look later!</b>

17:13.800 --> 17:15.390
<b>See ya later!</b>

17:16.180 --> 17:18.890
<b>The cooking utensils are well maintained.</b>

17:18.890 --> 17:20.580
<b>Looks like we can use them.</b>

17:21.700 --> 17:22.890
<b>Now, for the ingredients...</b>

17:22.890 --> 17:24.140
<b>Shield Hero.</b>

17:25.580 --> 17:28.740
<b>Would you let me cook dinner tonight?</b>

17:31.180 --> 17:34.720
<b>Atla barely remembers living here...</b>

17:35.230 --> 17:37.660
<b>...or our parents.</b>

17:38.450 --> 17:41.920
<b>So at the very least,
I want her to taste</b>

17:41.920 --> 17:44.080
<b>the food Mother used to make for us.</b>

17:45.010 --> 17:47.310
<b>A taste of home, huh?</b>

18:28.570 --> 18:32.440
<b>This is a taste I've never had before,
but it's delicious.</b>

18:32.440 --> 18:33.750
<b>Is that so?</b>

18:33.750 --> 18:35.880
<b>Are you wearing that outfit then, Atla?</b>

18:35.880 --> 18:38.120
<b>Do you like it?</b>

18:38.120 --> 18:41.140
<b>Since there was also one for big brother,
I'll get it ready.</b>

18:43.840 --> 18:44.940
<b>Fohl...</b>

18:45.410 --> 18:47.020
<b>Can I have a moment?</b>

18:52.920 --> 18:54.080
<b>So?</b>

18:58.180 --> 18:59.640
<b>What's missing?</b>

18:59.640 --> 19:05.320
<b>The sweetness, richness,
and maybe a bit of the aroma.</b>

19:05.320 --> 19:08.880
<b>There was this soft fragrance
that lingered in the nose.</b>

19:09.560 --> 19:13.410
<b>For this dish,
the closest seasoning would be...</b>

19:21.450 --> 19:23.230
<b>T-This is...!</b>

19:25.190 --> 19:28.150
<b>Wow! It looks delicious!</b>

19:29.930 --> 19:32.810
<b>It's very unique but has a wonderful aroma.</b>

19:32.810 --> 19:35.110
<b>So this is Siltvelt home cooking.</b>

19:35.450 --> 19:37.260
<b>I bet it'd go great with local sake.</b>

19:37.260 --> 19:39.310
<b>That's all you ever think about.</b>

19:39.310 --> 19:43.920
<b>Atla, Fohl worked hard
to make this for you.</b>

19:43.920 --> 19:45.340
<b>You should thank him.</b>

19:45.340 --> 19:48.660
<b>N-No! It's nothing like that!
I had help from you too!</b>

19:48.660 --> 19:50.040
<b>Understood.</b>

19:50.390 --> 19:54.210
<b>Thank you, big brother.
I'll enjoy it.</b>

19:55.010 --> 19:57.260
<b>Let's eat!</b>

19:59.230 --> 20:00.090
<b>So good!</b>

20:00.090 --> 20:02.040
<b>This is really well cooked!</b>

20:02.040 --> 20:06.040
<b>Atla, try that simmered dish again.</b>

20:06.040 --> 20:07.890
<b>Huh? Okay.</b>

20:13.820 --> 20:15.220
<b>How is it?</b>

20:16.180 --> 20:17.340
<b>It's delicious.</b>

20:17.820 --> 20:18.850
<b>This taste...</b>

20:19.710 --> 20:21.320
<b>I like it.</b>

20:23.800 --> 20:26.790
<b>Mother used to make this dish.</b>

20:27.160 --> 20:28.770
<b>Mother did?</b>

20:28.770 --> 20:31.440
<b>But the aroma seems different from earlier.</b>

20:31.440 --> 20:34.880
<b>I added a bit of seasoning from Melromarc.</b>

20:35.270 --> 20:37.920
<b>Just that made it change this much?</b>

20:37.920 --> 20:40.340
<b>If your mother is a human,</b>

20:40.340 --> 20:42.850
<b>I figured she might've seasoned it like that.</b>

20:43.160 --> 20:47.250
<b>And you figured that out instantly?</b>

20:47.250 --> 20:51.770
<b>This dish is like a mix of
demi-human and human cuisine.</b>

20:51.770 --> 20:54.240
<b>Just like Fohl and Atla.</b>

20:55.130 --> 20:56.420
<b>I see...</b>

20:57.310 --> 20:59.410
<b>So this is Father and Mother's taste...</b>

20:59.980 --> 21:02.810
<b>Master Naofumi, big brother.</b>

21:02.810 --> 21:06.870
<b>Could you teach me
how to make this dish too?</b>

21:07.960 --> 21:10.500
<b>I want to try cooking it myself.</b>

21:10.990 --> 21:14.230
<b>Ah, of course!</b>

21:14.230 --> 21:16.210
<b>Mother would be happy too!</b>

21:17.380 --> 21:22.380
<b>And so, we passed the time peacefully
at Fohl and Atla's home.</b>

21:31.540 --> 21:33.100
<b>Big brother!</b>

21:38.530 --> 21:40.210
<b>And finally...</b>

21:41.960 --> 21:45.140
<b>...the preparations for our ship
were about to be ready.</b>

21:45.660 --> 21:47.750
<b>Please help over there too!</b>

21:53.060 --> 21:54.360
<b>Master Naofumi.</b>

21:54.360 --> 21:57.300
<b>Yeah. We need to head back
to the village first.</b>

21:58.570 --> 22:01.710
<b>To choose the members
who'll be going to Q'ten Lo.</b>

23:36.180 --> 23:39.930
<b>Setting Sail</b>
